chx:Scope a res:ResearchScope ; res:hasResearchQuestion "What does Chapter 10 of Mastering Bitcoin (3rd edition) say about the Bitcoin network, which of its statements can be recomputed or run on Bitcoin Core 31.1 and on the census of the real network, and what has changed in Bitcoin Core, the BIPs and the network since the book went to print?" ; res:hasTimeWindow "Current as of 2026-10-15." .
